{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Collection Item","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404024","type":"Type"}],"id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/library/12931","identified_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"repository number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404621"}],"content":"12931","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"call number","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300311706"}],"content":"G1019 .N27 1958","type":"Identifier"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"preferred term","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300404670"}],"content":"National Geographic Society atlas folio  ","type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[],"timespan":{"_label":"1958-","type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"inscription statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435414"}],"content":"abq copy : fair condition : maps loose ; folio : fair condition.|SColl abq : Annotation by unknown on Lands of the Eastern Mediterranean ; Greece and the Aegean.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"Ephemera found inside back cover : Hammond's Decorative Maps : fold-out of maps intended to be used for decoration.\nFolio was intended for individual maps to be pasted into the binding. The maps enclosed in this folio are not pasted in, and not all of them appear to have been intended for this folio by the publisher. Contents listed are the items enclosed in the copy from the Abiquiu Bookroom.\nGeorgia O'Keeffe Personal Library.\nMaps called Atlas plate[s]; plates [8] and [28] issued without plate or number designation and called Atlas series.\nNumbered maps published at irregular intervals with the National geographic magazine.","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}